# docs/ is documentation, not configuration.
#
# Every top-level directory in this repository is a Stow package and deploys to
# ~/.config/<name>, so without this file `./install.sh` would create
# ~/.config/docs and link the documentation into it.
#
# An ignore file replaces stow's built-in list rather than extending it, so the
# patterns that matter here are written out. Each one is matched against the
# whole file name, so ".*" is everything.
.*
